WEBVTT

01:41.610 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.470 --> 01:48.940
[Episode 37]

01:49.400 --> 01:51.070
That day in the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation,

01:51.479 --> 01:53.280
I didn't try to make you perish into ashes.

01:57.229 --> 01:57.759
Yu,

01:58.070 --> 01:58.560
let's go.

02:05.310 --> 02:06.120
I've told you that

02:06.970 --> 02:08.080
you're not able to take him away.

02:10.330 --> 02:12.170
In front of the demonic weapon Dun Tian gave me,

02:12.910 --> 02:15.030
this little power is not enough.

02:19.910 --> 02:20.750
Please come quickly!

02:21.800 --> 02:22.800
Escort His Highness back to

02:22.800 --> 02:23.680
his palace for a rest now.

02:24.460 --> 02:25.510
Summon the imperial physician to treat him with medicine.

02:25.530 --> 02:27.120
[Cold Cloud Hall]

02:26.420 --> 02:27.380
Look after him carefully.

02:27.520 --> 02:28.120
-Yes.
-Yes.

02:28.960 --> 02:29.590
Where is Dun Tian?

02:30.000 --> 02:30.750
Your Highness,

02:30.960 --> 02:31.640
he's not in the hall.

02:36.870 --> 02:38.750
Then I'll just wait for him here.

02:39.750 --> 02:40.800
If he knows that

02:41.480 --> 02:42.840
I rescued Su Yu

02:42.870 --> 02:43.800
from Mu Qingge's hands,

02:45.730 --> 02:46.930
he'll surely trust me more, won't he?

03:08.370 --> 03:09.080
Here.

03:13.590 --> 03:14.150
Shui,

03:14.520 --> 03:15.280
wake up now.

03:15.470 --> 03:16.150
It's me.

03:21.200 --> 03:22.320
Just some petty tricks.

03:23.070 --> 03:23.950
Don't bother me here.

03:24.550 --> 03:25.520
Are you and Su Yu

03:25.710 --> 03:27.000
both under Dun Tian's control?

03:31.040 --> 03:32.390
What a foolish mortal.

03:33.150 --> 03:34.700
You thought that I would want to go back?

03:53.000 --> 03:54.840
So he has fallen so deeply into devilry?

03:56.890 --> 03:58.460
[Su Yishui]

03:58.570 --> 03:59.850
[Su Yu]

04:01.970 --> 04:03.250
Master, we're here.

04:06.600 --> 04:07.470
Now that we're faced with a great enemy,

04:07.840 --> 04:09.040
my strength alone is limited.

04:09.590 --> 04:10.430
I have to rely on you all

04:10.460 --> 04:11.930
to destroy Dun Tian's plot together.

04:12.580 --> 04:13.030
Ranran,

04:13.250 --> 04:13.880
if you need any help,

04:13.910 --> 04:14.750
just tell us.

04:15.120 --> 04:16.120
Now we know that

04:16.510 --> 04:18.070
in order to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

04:18.480 --> 04:19.040
it requires the huge

04:19.070 --> 04:20.269
spiritual channel power from the Heavenly Sects.

04:20.839 --> 04:21.720
That was why he came up with

04:21.750 --> 04:22.870
the method of using shadow people

04:23.120 --> 04:24.160
to seize the spiritual channel.

04:24.800 --> 04:26.200
He made Su Yishui fall into devilry

04:26.720 --> 04:28.600
because he wanted to take advantage of the Mortal-Demon Lord.

04:29.320 --> 04:31.050
Then why does he want to keep an eye on Su Yu?

04:32.270 --> 04:33.750
Su Yu is not a member of the Heavenly Sects.

04:34.710 --> 04:35.680
What's the thing that Su Yu has

04:36.270 --> 04:37.560
and is essential for

04:37.560 --> 04:38.159
the Three Thousand Realms Tower?

04:38.870 --> 04:40.310
Su Yu is the current Crown Prince.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.720
Perhaps opening the Three Thousand Realms Tower

04:42.830 --> 04:44.040
requires some worldly power.

04:44.630 --> 04:45.800
I'm afraid it's not that simple.

04:47.310 --> 04:48.310
But no matter what,

04:48.780 --> 04:49.570
Su Yu must be

04:49.600 --> 04:50.510
an important part of it.

04:51.360 --> 04:53.000
I will find a way to rescue him.

04:53.830 --> 04:54.510
Besides,

04:54.950 --> 04:56.480
where exactly is this tower?

04:57.480 --> 04:59.270
Xi'er, Gao Cang, Bai Baishan,

04:59.750 --> 05:00.690
go figure out the method

05:00.720 --> 05:01.870
of eradicating the shadow people now.

05:02.480 --> 05:03.950
Even if you have to search through all the records about strange creatures,

05:04.120 --> 05:04.800
you must find it.

05:05.190 --> 05:05.870
You have to be quick.

05:06.720 --> 05:07.160
-Yes.
-Yes.
-Yes.

05:07.680 --> 05:08.300
Zeng.

05:08.430 --> 05:09.510
Go help them, too.

05:11.490 --> 05:12.570
Also, help me keep a closer eye on

05:12.600 --> 05:13.560
Mu Ranwu's movements.

05:14.010 --> 05:15.490
She's now working for Dun Tian.

05:15.950 --> 05:16.360
Okay.

05:17.160 --> 05:17.920
I'll set off immediately

05:17.950 --> 05:19.800
to investigate the conditions of opening the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

05:20.070 --> 05:21.070
Only by figuring this out

05:21.310 --> 05:22.270
can we take corresponding actions.

05:23.040 --> 05:23.720
But Master,

05:24.070 --> 05:25.950
there's no way of asking about or investigating

05:26.070 --> 05:26.920
the Three Thousand Realms Tower.

05:27.510 --> 05:28.560
From what aspect are you going to start the investigation?

05:29.240 --> 05:30.310
Since there's no way of asking about it,

05:31.120 --> 05:32.430
I have no choice but to consult the future.

05:33.000 --> 05:33.510
The future?

05:34.350 --> 05:36.159
Back then, in Uncle Ye Xin's cabin,

05:36.430 --> 05:37.390
I found the Heavenly Book.

05:38.180 --> 05:38.770
After reading it,

05:38.800 --> 05:40.560
I feared that the Heavenly Book might be used by villains,

05:41.159 --> 05:42.460
so I hid it on Divine Dragon Island

05:42.770 --> 05:43.530
and sealed it there.

05:43.950 --> 05:45.510
As long as we can know the future first,

05:46.090 --> 05:46.880
we'll certainly know

05:47.070 --> 05:48.310
Dun Tian's next move.

05:48.750 --> 05:49.680
No matter what he wants,

05:50.310 --> 05:51.720
only by finding it first

05:52.070 --> 05:53.430
can we stop him.

05:53.870 --> 05:55.680
But prying into Heaven's secrets comes at a price.

05:56.070 --> 05:56.450
Master,

05:56.480 --> 05:57.510
are you really going to do this?

05:58.070 --> 05:59.190
Dun Tian's spiritual power is immense,

05:59.550 --> 06:01.110
and he acts with great caution.

06:01.800 --> 06:02.510
To defeat him,

06:02.870 --> 06:04.190
we can only take this risky move.

06:07.040 --> 06:07.560
Alright.

06:08.030 --> 06:09.040
Let's set off separately.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.510
Let's keep in touch with the sound transmission talismans anytime.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.070
You're indeed the Mortal-Demon Lord.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.390
You're really unlike ordinary mortals

06:20.870 --> 06:21.800
with their limited vision and knowledge.

06:24.870 --> 06:26.070
You've been keeping an eye on me.

06:29.040 --> 06:30.870
You took pains to summon me back here,

06:31.480 --> 06:32.190
but you didn't make it clear

06:32.190 --> 06:33.390
what your plan was.

06:33.920 --> 06:34.870
You're even wary of me constantly.

06:42.920 --> 06:44.390
What exactly do you mean?

06:45.350 --> 06:46.880
Back then, your cultivation was unparalleled.

06:46.990 --> 06:48.430
Since you want to open the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

06:48.800 --> 06:50.070
you would've done it long ago if you had been capable of it.

06:50.950 --> 06:52.340
Now that you're making such a big plan,

06:52.870 --> 06:53.730
it can only mean that

06:54.270 --> 06:55.870
the conditions of opening the Three Thousand Realms Tower

06:56.370 --> 06:57.010
haven't been fully

06:57.040 --> 06:58.240
grasped by you even till now.

06:58.800 --> 06:59.390
And you

06:59.680 --> 07:00.830
need my help.

07:01.410 --> 07:02.440
Since you want me to help you,

07:03.270 --> 07:04.950
shouldn't you show some sincerity?

07:09.160 --> 07:10.040
You're right.

07:10.920 --> 07:11.390
However,

07:11.750 --> 07:12.950
you're only right about part of it.

07:13.640 --> 07:15.000
To open the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

07:15.510 --> 07:16.510
it's necessary to gather

07:17.000 --> 07:18.040
the Child of the Human Emperor,

07:18.270 --> 07:19.310
the Child of the Divine Dragon

07:19.630 --> 07:20.310
and you,

07:21.040 --> 07:21.920
the Child of the True Devil.

07:22.510 --> 07:24.220
I have to offer the blood of the Three Children to the tower

07:24.810 --> 07:25.890
and then use the massive spiritual channel

07:25.920 --> 07:26.860
as the energy.

07:27.360 --> 07:28.750
That's the only way to open the tower.

07:29.310 --> 07:30.430
I've summoned you back here

07:31.000 --> 07:32.240
not just to help myself

07:32.470 --> 07:33.510
seize the Heavenly Sects' spiritual channel.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.720
What's more, you're also

07:36.190 --> 07:37.480
crucial to me.

07:39.630 --> 07:40.710
Defying Heaven's will

07:40.920 --> 07:42.190
is bound to be extremely risky.

07:42.560 --> 07:43.750
We can't afford any mistakes.

07:44.430 --> 07:45.120
Previously, you said that

07:45.120 --> 07:46.390
you had selected the location for the tower's core.

07:47.270 --> 07:48.159
Is it reliable?

07:51.950 --> 07:53.000
There's no need to worry about it.

07:53.600 --> 07:54.870
I have already made all the preparations.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.390
Aren't you afraid that members of the Heavenly Sects

07:56.390 --> 07:57.310
will find that place first?

07:58.690 --> 07:59.810
No one will find that place.

08:00.950 --> 08:02.040
However, there is one thing

08:02.460 --> 08:03.670
which I'm quite worried about.

08:03.950 --> 08:05.600
Back then, that girl found the Heavenly Book,

08:06.160 --> 08:07.830
and she sealed it on Dragon Island.

08:09.070 --> 08:10.630
The person monitoring the Wester Sect told me that

08:11.000 --> 08:12.390
she had already flown towards Dragon Island.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.360
If she pries into the secrets of the Heavenly Book successfully,

08:15.070 --> 08:16.480
all our plans will be exposed.

08:16.950 --> 08:18.310
It will be difficult for us to deal with it then.

08:26.070 --> 08:26.680
If I ask you

08:26.680 --> 08:28.000
to go destroy the Heavenly Book,

08:28.750 --> 08:29.480
this time,

08:31.750 --> 08:33.390
you won't fail, will you?

08:47.880 --> 08:48.950
Imperial physician, please take care.

08:49.000 --> 08:49.580
Bye.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.120
Fortunately, I have the talisman which Ranran gave me.

09:03.600 --> 09:04.270
In this way,

09:04.560 --> 09:05.720
others won't be able to recognize me.

09:25.270 --> 09:25.950
Water.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.510
Bring me some water!

09:30.240 --> 09:31.150
Come over here now!

09:43.600 --> 09:44.150
Your Highness.

10:04.600 --> 10:05.840
What's your name?

10:09.150 --> 10:09.750
The tea you served

10:09.750 --> 10:11.030
suits my taste very well.

10:17.360 --> 10:18.150
Your Highness.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.120
My...

10:20.480 --> 10:21.390
My name is Xueyan.

10:22.270 --> 10:23.390
I'm a new palace maid here.

10:32.390 --> 10:33.790
Help me to the window to take a look.

10:55.200 --> 10:56.240
The wind is strong this year.

10:58.150 --> 10:59.750
I wonder whether it'll also snow heavily

11:01.200 --> 11:02.440
when the winter snow comes.

11:04.440 --> 11:05.750
It is said that after a heavy snow,

11:09.270 --> 11:10.390
it'll be a year with a good harvest.

11:14.720 --> 11:15.550
Do you know

11:16.600 --> 11:18.150
when the Three Thousand Realms Tower opens,

11:19.030 --> 11:19.600
the world in your eyes

11:19.600 --> 11:20.960
will be destroyed?

11:22.330 --> 11:23.860
The people you claim to love

11:23.880 --> 11:24.920
and the country you're trying to protect

11:25.510 --> 11:26.570
will all perish because of

11:26.600 --> 11:27.550
your desire.

11:28.510 --> 11:29.750
If all of them disappear,

11:31.200 --> 11:32.240
don't you think it'll be such a pity?

11:34.440 --> 11:35.120
Xueyan.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.600
Do you think I will be a wise ruler?

11:46.550 --> 11:47.440
Be honest with me.

11:49.440 --> 11:51.360
I hope that Your Highness will be a wise ruler.

11:52.510 --> 11:53.550
When people are in a desperate situation,

11:54.240 --> 11:55.390
mistakes are inevitable.

11:56.610 --> 11:59.130
But Your Highness, if you want to be a wise ruler,

11:59.670 --> 12:00.870
you will certainly be able to do it.

12:28.200 --> 12:28.910
Where is he?

12:31.670 --> 12:33.360
It's only been a short while, and he has disappeared.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.080
Tell me where he is!

12:43.600 --> 12:44.320
That's strange.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.450
All this night, I didn't sense

12:46.480 --> 12:47.600
any Heavenly people coming here.

12:48.510 --> 12:50.000
Who has taken him away?

13:05.030 --> 13:06.150
He found that place.

13:22.260 --> 13:23.260
Shui, you're here.

13:24.480 --> 13:25.080
Shui.

13:25.590 --> 13:26.590
Did Dun Tian hurt you?

13:27.100 --> 13:28.340
Come on. Let's go home.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.390
Is it fun to deceive me

13:39.910 --> 13:40.720
with such a trick?

13:42.300 --> 13:42.970
I was almost

13:43.000 --> 13:44.380
fooled by your tricks.

13:45.150 --> 13:45.870
I didn't expect that

13:46.540 --> 13:47.350
you would be able to resist

13:47.380 --> 13:48.540
till now with a trace of spiritual soul

13:48.910 --> 13:49.960
inside the void.

13:51.000 --> 13:52.720
You haven't turned into a devil at all.

14:06.050 --> 14:07.120
If I hadn't done this,

14:07.910 --> 14:08.930
I wouldn't have known the place

14:08.960 --> 14:10.080
where you initiated the tower.

14:10.630 --> 14:12.080
But you realized it too late.

14:12.670 --> 14:14.120
I've already destroyed that place.

14:19.670 --> 14:20.480
Dun Tian.

14:21.550 --> 14:23.360
No matter how well you've hidden the tower's core,

14:24.000 --> 14:25.720
it'll still be destroyed by me eventually.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.630
Brother, why are you here?

14:36.630 --> 14:38.080
As for that fake Su Xiaoxiao,

14:39.240 --> 14:40.390
I've eliminated her, too.

14:40.820 --> 14:41.510
The tower's core

14:41.540 --> 14:42.940
was indeed destroyed by you!

14:46.390 --> 14:47.120
So you've found out about everything?

14:49.320 --> 14:50.480
That's interesting.

14:55.550 --> 14:56.850
To find the tower's core,

14:57.720 --> 14:59.840
you must have put in a lot of effort, right?

15:00.750 --> 15:02.600
Every time we talked about the location of the tower's core,

15:03.030 --> 15:04.000
you were always evasive

15:04.000 --> 15:04.910
and tried to hide the truth.

15:05.440 --> 15:07.360
Obviously, the tower's core is extremely crucial.

15:08.320 --> 15:08.910
But I never saw you

15:08.910 --> 15:10.670
taking any actions to guard it.

15:11.360 --> 15:12.120
It indicated that

15:12.120 --> 15:13.910
you already controlled this place completely and definitely.

15:14.440 --> 15:15.550
And in this world, what place

15:15.550 --> 15:16.670
do you know so well?

15:17.550 --> 15:18.390
This reminded me of

15:18.390 --> 15:19.960
the cabin where you lived as Ye Xin.

15:20.510 --> 15:21.630
It was an exact replica of

15:21.630 --> 15:22.840
the old home where you lived with your wife and daughter.

15:23.630 --> 15:25.150
Since you refused to let go of your obsession

15:25.480 --> 15:26.750
and wanted to look back upon everything,

15:27.200 --> 15:28.790
I supposed it started from that place.

15:29.550 --> 15:30.790
When I went to check the cabin,

15:31.320 --> 15:32.870
there was nothing unusual on the surface,

15:33.360 --> 15:35.320
but the barrier concealing spiritual power was underground.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.670
When I uprooted and destroyed the cabin,

15:38.080 --> 15:39.050
the huge spiritual channel

15:39.080 --> 15:39.960
was hidden beneath it indeed.

15:40.670 --> 15:41.960
I've destroyed that place.

15:42.840 --> 15:43.600
Even if you can obtain

15:43.630 --> 15:44.670
the Three Children in your plan,

15:44.910 --> 15:46.030
there'll be no place for you to initiate the tower.

15:47.200 --> 15:47.790
Moreover,

15:48.200 --> 15:49.120
you can obtain

15:49.870 --> 15:51.120
neither Su Yu nor me.

15:53.550 --> 15:54.360
Su Yishui,

15:55.370 --> 15:56.520
I didn't expect that though you have many

15:56.550 --> 15:57.510
regrets in your life,

15:58.390 --> 15:59.870
you would still refuse to join me in defying Heaven

16:00.360 --> 16:02.000
and making amends for regrets, huh?

16:03.090 --> 16:03.840
Only the incompetent people

16:03.860 --> 16:05.350
would wish to turn back time.

16:06.000 --> 16:07.480
I've always only moved forward

16:07.960 --> 16:08.960
without looking back.

16:13.010 --> 16:13.840
Don't you want to go to a world

16:13.870 --> 16:15.240
where you're not a devil's child

16:15.630 --> 16:16.840
and haven't lost your beloved woman

16:17.270 --> 16:18.910
and family?

16:20.150 --> 16:21.240
As people journey through life,

16:22.000 --> 16:22.790
they tend to lose many things

16:22.790 --> 16:24.150
that they originally wanted to obtain.

16:25.450 --> 16:26.260
But they might also gain many things

16:26.280 --> 16:27.630
that they never thought they'd have.

16:28.510 --> 16:29.720
I only want to move forward,

16:30.670 --> 16:32.270
with no intention of changing even a bit of the current situation.

16:34.200 --> 16:34.720
Fine.

16:36.440 --> 16:37.350
That's interesting.

16:50.320 --> 16:51.720
Do you really think that with your own power,

16:52.120 --> 16:53.630
you can stop me?

16:54.360 --> 16:55.240
You thought that the Soul-Cleansing Charm

16:55.240 --> 16:56.600
only removed your memories.

16:57.010 --> 16:57.840
The Falling Water in that charm

16:57.870 --> 16:59.600
was actually my backup plan to subdue you.

17:00.360 --> 17:01.240
I'm not the only one working on this,

17:02.280 --> 17:03.950
but Ranran is also about to reach Dragon Island.

17:04.640 --> 17:06.000
As long as she reads the Heavenly Book,

17:06.440 --> 17:07.680
she'll know your plan

17:08.000 --> 17:09.030
and will surely stop you.

17:09.750 --> 17:10.589
You were like this in your former life,

17:10.960 --> 17:12.109
and you're still the same in this life.

17:12.440 --> 17:13.069
She's the one

17:13.440 --> 17:14.680
who has made you so weak

17:15.069 --> 17:15.720
and foolish.

17:16.560 --> 17:17.359
Now that

17:18.000 --> 17:19.710
she has already become your weakness,

17:19.960 --> 17:21.000
we must eliminate her immediately.

17:46.480 --> 17:47.350
Mortal-Demon Lord,

17:48.310 --> 17:49.070
destroy the Heavenly Book

17:49.590 --> 17:50.720
and kill Xue Ranran

17:51.750 --> 17:52.440
to forever eliminate

17:53.400 --> 17:55.070
the future troubles for us.

17:58.530 --> 18:02.180
[Cliff outside Dragon Island]

18:01.000 --> 18:03.310
I'm Xue Ranran from the Wester Sect! I'd like to meet the Dragon Goddess!

18:06.550 --> 18:09.000
I'm Xue Ranran from the Wester Sect! I'd like to meet the Dragon Goddess!

18:12.400 --> 18:13.220
Benefactor!

18:15.590 --> 18:17.030
Benefactor, it's really you.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.280
You're...

18:18.390 --> 18:19.520
that little dragon from the capital?

18:19.550 --> 18:20.070
Yes.

18:19.960 --> 18:23.080
[Little Green Dragon, Qing Luo]

18:20.240 --> 18:21.370
I've recovered from my injuries

18:21.430 --> 18:22.470
and can turn into the human form now.

18:22.720 --> 18:23.720
So you want to enter Dragon Island?

18:24.350 --> 18:25.590
I have an urgent matter to discuss with the Dragon Goddess.

18:26.160 --> 18:28.030
My Mother Goddess has refused to see outsiders in recent years.

18:28.310 --> 18:28.920
Even when those old fellows

18:28.920 --> 18:29.750
from the Immortal Realm came here,

18:29.750 --> 18:30.480
it was still useless.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.110
If you want to see her,

18:32.680 --> 18:33.510
I'll figure out a way.

18:33.680 --> 18:34.480
I'll take you to enter the island first.

18:40.300 --> 18:41.210
[Dragon Island]

18:48.440 --> 18:49.310
Let me check on my Mother Goddess first

18:49.330 --> 18:50.440
to see how her mood is today.

18:51.070 --> 18:51.640
Qing Luo!

18:52.210 --> 18:53.580
I've been too lenient with you.

18:53.980 --> 18:55.980
How dare you bring a mortal to Dragon Island without permission?

18:59.160 --> 18:59.720
Mother Goddess,

19:00.400 --> 19:01.930
she is not an ordinary mortal.

19:02.230 --> 19:03.040
Previously, I was

19:03.070 --> 19:04.680
confined in water by the imperial family of the mortal world.

19:04.880 --> 19:06.120
She was the one who saved me.

19:06.770 --> 19:07.690
In that case,

19:06.810 --> 19:09.660
[Dragon Goddess]

19:08.200 --> 19:09.880
I'll forgive you for trespassing on my island.

19:10.590 --> 19:12.350
You cultivators from the mortal world come here

19:12.640 --> 19:14.510
only to get magical treasures and spiritual medicine.

19:15.240 --> 19:15.810
Just tell me

19:15.920 --> 19:16.750
what you want.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.830
Since you've done Qing Luo a favor,

19:19.720 --> 19:20.960
I won't treat you badly.

19:23.720 --> 19:25.110
I'm here not for treasures,

19:25.790 --> 19:27.420
but to retrieve something.

19:28.100 --> 19:29.300
You're here to retrieve something?

19:29.820 --> 19:30.210
Yes.

19:31.170 --> 19:32.130
Twenty years ago,

19:32.510 --> 19:34.200
I hid an item from the Immortal Realm

19:34.480 --> 19:35.400
on Dragon Island.

19:46.200 --> 19:47.510
So you're the one who hid

19:47.510 --> 19:49.510
the Heavenly Book on Dragon Island?

19:50.000 --> 19:50.790
Do you know

19:51.200 --> 19:52.270
how many times

19:52.750 --> 19:54.880
people from the Immortal Realm have come to bother us about this?

19:55.830 --> 19:57.270
How dare you!

19:59.720 --> 20:00.590
Dragon Goddess, you're wise.

20:01.310 --> 20:02.640
During the chaos of the Spirit Spring,

20:03.030 --> 20:04.550
I had no choice but to borrow the Heavenly Book for a look.

20:04.900 --> 20:05.610
To prevent this treasure

20:05.640 --> 20:06.940
from causing turmoil in the mortal world again,

20:07.190 --> 20:08.950
I had to hide it on Dragon Island.

20:09.750 --> 20:10.680
What happened in the mortal world

20:10.700 --> 20:12.090
was none of our Dragon Island's business.

20:12.640 --> 20:14.160
How could you make us get involved in it?

20:14.680 --> 20:15.830
Even though you're unwilling to accept it,

20:16.400 --> 20:18.010
the Dragon Clan was already involved in it long ago.

20:18.880 --> 20:20.320
Dragon Goddess, do you still remember Meng Zhang?

20:22.800 --> 20:24.080
Meng Zhang descended to the mortal world

20:24.460 --> 20:26.090
all because of the troubles caused by the Spirit Spring.

20:26.590 --> 20:27.960
If you ignore this,

20:28.450 --> 20:29.660
then I'm afraid the crisis this time

20:29.950 --> 20:31.620
might be even severer than before.

20:33.590 --> 20:34.720
The Dragon Clan's victims

20:35.300 --> 20:36.850
won't be limited to Meng Zhang anymore.

20:39.070 --> 20:39.680
Fine.

20:40.960 --> 20:42.270
If you want to read the Heavenly Book,

20:42.750 --> 20:43.590
then just read it.

20:51.240 --> 20:52.880
The Heavenly Book is inside it.

20:54.970 --> 20:55.930
That crack...

20:58.780 --> 20:59.610
Over these years,

20:59.640 --> 21:01.350
the Immortal Realm kept sending people to bother us,

21:02.170 --> 21:03.410
so I created

21:03.440 --> 21:04.440
a spatial crack

21:05.480 --> 21:07.160
and threw the Heavenly Book into it.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.600
We finally had a few years of peace.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.720
Go inside and retrieve it yourself.

21:13.480 --> 21:14.850
Be careful with everything.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.240
Mother Goddess.

21:24.580 --> 21:26.450
My benefactor won't be in danger, will she?

21:27.350 --> 21:28.440
That depends on whether

21:29.310 --> 21:31.240
she can defeat Heaven's will.

21:41.640 --> 21:43.110
I found you.

21:52.000 --> 21:52.510
You...

21:53.360 --> 21:53.970
actually managed to enter

21:54.000 --> 21:55.290
the space created by the Dragon Goddess?

21:55.980 --> 21:57.420
Since I've collaborated with Dun Tian,

21:58.610 --> 21:59.240
in this world,

21:59.270 --> 22:00.480
are there any places that I can't enter?

22:03.440 --> 22:04.750
The Heavenly Book is over there.

22:06.750 --> 22:08.440
Let's see which of us can get it first!

23:14.920 --> 23:15.830
Mu Qingge.

23:16.750 --> 23:17.520
Twenty years ago,

23:17.550 --> 23:19.310
I was already able to domineer over everything.

23:19.880 --> 23:20.590
Because of you,

23:20.590 --> 23:21.830
I was sealed for many more years.

23:22.270 --> 23:23.750
Now that I'm out,

23:24.550 --> 23:26.350
we need to get even with each other properly.

23:27.160 --> 23:28.440
We need to get even with each other for many things indeed.

23:28.920 --> 23:30.160
But what I want to do the most now

23:30.400 --> 23:31.790
is to pry into Dun Tian's plan

23:32.110 --> 23:33.160
and then save Shui.

23:33.580 --> 23:34.790
Let me borrow your demonic energy.

23:47.640 --> 23:48.770
All the Three Children are gathered here.

23:49.460 --> 23:51.150
The Three Thousand Realms Tower has been built.

23:51.830 --> 23:54.110
As an oblation, this world

23:54.770 --> 23:56.010
shall shatter now!

24:03.930 --> 24:04.890
To build the Three Thousand Realms Tower,

24:04.920 --> 24:06.160
the most important things are the Three Children.

24:06.640 --> 24:07.350
Su Yu

24:07.790 --> 24:08.720
is the Child of the Human Emperor,

24:09.750 --> 24:10.920
while Shui is the devil's child.

24:11.720 --> 24:13.240
Who exactly is the third child?

24:13.680 --> 24:15.510
I'll make you disappear along with the Heavenly Book!

24:23.480 --> 24:24.720
You seem to have forgotten that

24:25.030 --> 24:27.110
destroying it is much easier than snatching it.

24:36.830 --> 24:37.960
There's something I need to tell you.

24:38.550 --> 24:39.790
Just now, when I borrowed your demonic energy,

24:39.960 --> 24:41.550
my purpose was not only to break the Heavenly Book's seal

24:42.160 --> 24:43.570
but also to send a message to the Dragon Goddess.

24:54.440 --> 24:55.680
Glorious Divine Power.

24:56.310 --> 24:57.590
The Azure Dragon subdues devils.

25:04.750 --> 25:06.030
Fire-refined Dragon Crystal?

25:07.140 --> 25:08.430
You knew I would come here?

25:11.920 --> 25:12.480
That's right.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.960
If you want to read the Heavenly Book,

25:19.440 --> 25:20.270
then just read it.

25:20.790 --> 25:22.270
I have one more request.

25:22.990 --> 25:23.900
The person who has brought chaos to the world

25:24.350 --> 25:26.000
fears that his plan will be exposed by the Heavenly Book.

25:26.550 --> 25:28.160
So when I open the Heavenly Book,

25:28.480 --> 25:29.200
he will definitely try to stop me.

25:32.960 --> 25:34.240
I've heard that if the Gold Refining Fire

25:34.270 --> 25:35.200
is integrated with Dragon Breath,

25:35.860 --> 25:36.380
it can turn into

25:36.400 --> 25:37.650
the Fire-refined Dragon Crystal that can destroy

25:37.680 --> 25:38.510
all devils in each realm.

25:42.680 --> 25:43.750
Dragon Goddess, please give me this treasure

25:44.400 --> 25:45.350
to ensure the peace of the mortal world.

25:46.730 --> 25:48.420
You once helped Meng Zhang and Qing Luo.

25:49.310 --> 25:50.200
I will help you make

25:50.680 --> 25:51.890
the Fire-refined Dragon Crystal.

25:52.530 --> 25:53.110
However,

25:54.240 --> 25:55.790
don't you want to stay alive anymore?

25:56.970 --> 25:59.010
The Heavenly Book is made from dragon scales.

25:59.750 --> 26:01.800
Although I'm not as far-sighted as the Heavenly Book,

26:02.350 --> 26:04.350
I do have the ability to foresee the future.

26:05.150 --> 26:06.020
From you,

26:06.720 --> 26:08.350
I've foreseen an inevitable death.

26:20.540 --> 26:21.590
If you use the Fire-refined Dragon Crystal

26:21.620 --> 26:22.770
to dispel his demonic energy,

26:23.530 --> 26:25.090
you will be killed by him.

26:33.160 --> 26:34.030
Even so,

26:35.310 --> 26:36.920
there are some things that I have to do.

26:41.350 --> 26:41.920
Shui.

26:42.750 --> 26:43.640
I'm here to save you!

26:52.310 --> 26:53.550
Xue Ranran.

26:54.030 --> 26:55.640
You've been so scheming.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.750
Do you think that I entered

26:57.920 --> 26:59.270
this space alone?

27:09.880 --> 27:10.750
Someone is trying to destroy the formation.

27:13.680 --> 27:14.960
To finish such an important matter,

27:15.720 --> 27:18.200
how can I not personally oversee it?

27:21.310 --> 27:22.400
As long as I'm faster,

27:22.830 --> 27:23.920
Shui can be saved.

27:32.880 --> 27:33.480
Ranran.

27:33.710 --> 27:35.110
Go! Leave now!

27:39.770 --> 27:41.760
I've long hated that I can't completely get rid of Su Yishui

27:41.790 --> 27:42.720
at the bottom of my heart.

27:43.070 --> 27:44.880
Today, I'll kill you and dig out the Essence Core.

27:45.270 --> 27:46.960
Then he will never appear again.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.310
I'm just inches away from success.

28:19.290 --> 28:19.880
No.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.000
No way!

28:21.350 --> 28:22.720
I can never...

29:00.110 --> 29:01.440
You can still emerge from

29:01.440 --> 29:02.270
the consciousness?

29:02.960 --> 29:04.830
This time, I will destroy you completely!

29:09.140 --> 29:10.230
Divine Dragon Light?

29:10.640 --> 29:11.350
Dragon Goddess?

29:34.110 --> 29:34.880
Shui!

29:38.020 --> 29:44.720
♫Who knows the loneliness of mountains and seas?♫

29:38.310 --> 29:38.920
Let's...

29:43.550 --> 29:44.590
eliminate him together.

29:45.030 --> 29:51.360
♫The sharp wind cuts at my heart♫

29:52.040 --> 29:55.530
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

29:54.480 --> 29:55.240
Shui!

29:55.650 --> 29:59.300
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

29:58.110 --> 29:59.070
Shui!

29:59.920 --> 30:06.630
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

30:07.530 --> 30:10.240
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

30:10.260 --> 30:13.920
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

30:14.110 --> 30:14.750
Shui!

30:14.320 --> 30:17.200
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

30:16.030 --> 30:16.680
Shui!

30:17.450 --> 30:20.990
♫Die in this world♫

30:20.750 --> 30:23.110
You shattered your own Essence Core.

30:21.750 --> 30:25.310
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

30:25.940 --> 30:28.770
♫I haven't said anything yet, my heart is clear♫

30:29.290 --> 30:35.270
♫I still don't regret it; I'll pay for it all my life♫

30:35.680 --> 30:38.560
♫You know my heart, won't go against my wishes♫

30:38.820 --> 30:42.350
♫Don't speak of redressing injustices♫

30:42.610 --> 30:45.220
♫Don't let others pity me♫

30:45.500 --> 30:49.960
♫Try your best to forget me♫

30:50.540 --> 30:53.960
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

30:54.530 --> 30:57.710
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

30:57.990 --> 31:04.410
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

31:04.680 --> 31:05.400
Shui.

31:04.730 --> 31:07.930
♫No pain, no resentment♫

31:07.640 --> 31:08.350
Master.

31:10.480 --> 31:11.440
Master!

31:11.460 --> 31:18.190
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

31:14.920 --> 31:16.440
Wake up!

31:18.310 --> 31:20.200
Wake up now!

31:18.500 --> 31:24.720
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

31:23.270 --> 31:24.790
No!

31:25.530 --> 31:28.530
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

31:27.440 --> 31:28.680
Shui!

31:29.220 --> 31:32.280
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

31:32.720 --> 31:34.350
Master!

31:33.310 --> 31:40.580
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

31:38.680 --> 31:40.960
Wake up!

31:41.050 --> 31:43.870
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

31:43.960 --> 31:47.620
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

31:48.040 --> 31:50.360
♫Don't let others pity me♫

31:50.390 --> 31:54.850
♫Try your best to forget me♫

31:55.430 --> 31:58.850
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

31:59.430 --> 32:02.600
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

32:02.890 --> 32:09.300
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

32:03.770 --> 32:04.420
I didn't expect that

32:04.920 --> 32:05.880
for your sake,

32:06.520 --> 32:07.720
he would defy and change Heaven's will

32:08.000 --> 32:09.030
and destroy his own Essence Core.

32:09.510 --> 32:15.880
♫Only love is the unbreakable spell♫

32:11.920 --> 32:13.000
I'm going to save you.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.070
Mount Cuiwei.

32:16.560 --> 32:22.690
♫No need to feel surprised people in the world don't know how to break it♫

32:19.000 --> 32:20.290
I have to go to Mount Cuiwei.

32:21.880 --> 32:22.510
Qing Luo.

32:23.510 --> 32:24.310
Escort her there.

32:23.640 --> 32:27.060
♫Sealing your lips, never to speak again♫

32:27.200 --> 32:30.600
♫Even if I were to leap into the abyss♫

32:30.720 --> 32:31.310
Mother Goddess.

32:31.260 --> 32:37.360
♫If you are safe, I would embrace death without a second thought♫

32:32.590 --> 32:33.510
Can he really be saved?

32:48.550 --> 32:49.640
He destroyed his own Essence Core.

32:50.390 --> 32:52.250
His demonic energy was dispersed by the Fire-refined Dragon Crystal.

32:52.830 --> 32:53.680
But without the protection of the Golden Core,

32:53.700 --> 32:55.030
his internal meridians were also

32:55.380 --> 32:56.810
severely damaged by the Fire-refined Dragon Crystal.

32:57.120 --> 32:58.250
His foundation is completely gone.

32:58.590 --> 32:59.510
His Spirit Root is totally broken.

33:00.240 --> 33:01.640
Even if spiritual pills and power are infused into his body,

33:01.860 --> 33:03.030
it would be like a stone sinking into the sea

33:03.880 --> 33:04.440
and would be useless.

33:05.110 --> 33:06.400
Is there really no other way?

33:06.870 --> 33:08.200
If his Golden Core had still existed,

33:08.480 --> 33:09.680
he could repair his Spirit Root

33:09.680 --> 33:10.640
and meridians by himself.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.750
But now,

33:12.080 --> 33:12.690
no external forces

33:12.720 --> 33:13.830
can enter his body.

33:14.340 --> 33:15.950
I have half of his Golden Core inside my body.

33:16.110 --> 33:17.000
I'll give it back to him.

33:17.590 --> 33:18.030
Don't do that.

33:18.400 --> 33:19.350
Since he used half of his Golden Core

33:19.350 --> 33:20.030
to help you come back to life,

33:20.300 --> 33:20.930
that Golden Core has already

33:20.960 --> 33:22.160
turned into drops of spiritual power

33:22.180 --> 33:23.410
and are scattered in your heart.

33:23.440 --> 33:24.440
It's no longer a physical object.

33:24.550 --> 33:25.510
Whether you take one or half of it

33:25.680 --> 33:26.590
out of your body,

33:26.790 --> 33:28.350
it will affect your entire body.

33:28.640 --> 33:30.070
You'll perish in the end.

33:30.640 --> 33:31.120
Ranran.

33:31.590 --> 33:32.470
If something bad happens to you,

33:32.780 --> 33:33.650
what he did today

33:33.680 --> 33:34.680
will be in vain.

33:35.830 --> 33:37.000
After his soul was cleansed,

33:37.220 --> 33:39.290
he kept talking about getting back his Essence Core.

33:39.440 --> 33:40.680
But in the end, for my sake,

33:41.260 --> 33:42.320
he even sacrificed

33:42.340 --> 33:43.530
his own Essence Core.

33:44.720 --> 33:46.070
There must be another way.

33:47.070 --> 33:47.920
Golden Core...

33:49.440 --> 33:51.110
I once used a Golden Core to seal the Spirit Spring.

33:51.780 --> 33:53.370
After I sealed the Spirit Spring in the netherworld,

33:53.880 --> 33:55.270
the Golden Core was shattered and scattered in the netherworld.

33:56.360 --> 33:57.800
I can collect all the fragments

33:57.830 --> 33:58.680
and reassemble them.

33:59.340 --> 34:00.140
The entrance to the netherworld

34:00.400 --> 34:01.400
has been completely sealed.

34:02.110 --> 34:03.510
It's not that easy to go back there.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.070
There must be a way.

34:05.550 --> 34:06.240
I'm going to give it a try.

34:06.270 --> 34:06.720
Wait!

34:07.350 --> 34:08.510
If you insist on going to the netherworld,

34:09.840 --> 34:10.719
I have an idea.

34:11.630 --> 34:12.590
When you were in the netherworld,

34:12.880 --> 34:13.960
did you use any golden talismans?

34:14.760 --> 34:15.620
Do you have

34:16.010 --> 34:16.520
any of the same

34:16.550 --> 34:17.550
golden talismans with you now?

34:18.800 --> 34:19.230
Yes.

34:21.070 --> 34:21.630
Do you

34:22.040 --> 34:22.600
want to use

34:22.630 --> 34:23.800
the remaining spiritual power of the golden talisman

34:24.150 --> 34:25.630
to connect the netherworld and this world?

34:26.400 --> 34:26.800
Yes.

34:27.590 --> 34:29.400
The spiritual power of the golden talisman can connect the two worlds.

34:30.880 --> 34:31.510
But, girl,

34:32.030 --> 34:33.000
if I want to send you

34:33.000 --> 34:33.800
over there completely,

34:34.230 --> 34:35.670
my magical power won't be big enough to sustain it.

34:36.550 --> 34:37.070
But...

34:38.150 --> 34:39.280
But you've mastered the Soul Splitting Technique.

34:40.179 --> 34:41.540
Sending a piece of your split soul there

34:41.710 --> 34:42.480
might be worth a try.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.320
No, no.

34:43.760 --> 34:44.880
The split soul's spiritual power is weak.

34:45.000 --> 34:45.980
What if the split soul encounters

34:46.440 --> 34:48.190
demonic creatures and is torn apart in the netherworld?

34:48.670 --> 34:49.550
He's right.

34:50.150 --> 34:50.920
Let's forget about it then.

34:51.969 --> 34:53.080
He even turned my inevitable

34:53.110 --> 34:54.070
death around.

34:54.800 --> 34:56.190
Now that I have a chance to save him,

34:56.550 --> 34:57.800
I will never give up.

35:09.320 --> 35:10.000
Let's begin.

35:40.270 --> 35:42.130
This device will automatically search for

35:42.150 --> 35:43.760
the locations of the Golden Core fragments.

35:44.110 --> 35:45.480
You just need to hold this device

35:45.730 --> 35:47.480
to get close to them and collect them.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.510
There's a fragment nearby.

36:35.950 --> 36:36.910
It's the last piece.

36:37.400 --> 36:38.550
It's right in the depths of the netherworld.

36:44.920 --> 36:45.400
Oh, no.

36:45.720 --> 36:46.330
Her energy must have

36:46.360 --> 36:47.570
been detected by the demonic creatures,

36:47.710 --> 36:48.630
and she's now being attacked by them.

36:52.190 --> 36:53.280
Girl, come back now!

36:53.360 --> 36:54.200
Don't be reckless!

37:02.460 --> 37:03.710
There's only one piece left.

37:04.230 --> 37:05.550
I absolutely won't give up.

37:24.480 --> 37:26.110
Since the power of Heaven and Earth can be borrowed,

37:27.110 --> 37:29.110
why can't I borrow demonic energy?

37:30.440 --> 37:31.070
Come on!

37:34.710 --> 37:35.510
One wisp of qi

37:35.760 --> 37:36.760
to break the galaxy!

38:04.510 --> 38:05.030
Ranran!

38:06.110 --> 38:06.800
The Golden Core...

38:07.120 --> 38:08.010
I've collected it and brought it back.

38:08.440 --> 38:09.280
Shui can be saved now.

38:20.200 --> 38:21.000
Is it okay now?

38:23.480 --> 38:24.840
The Golden Core can't enter his heart.

38:25.710 --> 38:26.590
It shouldn't be like this.

38:29.030 --> 38:29.590
Unless...

38:30.230 --> 38:31.070
he's rejecting

38:31.320 --> 38:32.320
the Golden Core himself.

38:34.590 --> 38:35.280
Let me check on it.

38:40.070 --> 38:40.630
Indeed,

38:41.320 --> 38:42.320
his spiritual heart is wavering.

38:42.550 --> 38:43.360
He's not accepting the Golden Core.

38:43.740 --> 38:45.310
Could it be that his demonic energy hasn't completely dissipated,

38:45.710 --> 38:46.710
so he's being influenced by it?

38:48.320 --> 38:49.190
That's not the reason.

38:49.510 --> 38:50.440
His consciousness is in chaos.

38:50.710 --> 38:52.070
He's trapped in a nightmare.

38:52.480 --> 38:53.480
It's caused by something bothering his mind.

38:53.880 --> 38:55.710
If the nightmare isn't removed, his spiritual heart will be destroyed.

38:56.110 --> 38:57.880
The Golden Core surely can't enter his heart.

38:58.480 --> 38:59.150
As the saying goes,

38:59.630 --> 39:00.510
"When the skin is gone,

39:00.800 --> 39:01.800
the hair on it won't exist, either."

39:02.110 --> 39:03.630
All our efforts are in vain, aren't they?

39:04.320 --> 39:04.880
Liang,

39:05.110 --> 39:06.190
if this continues,

39:06.840 --> 39:07.480
I'm afraid he'll...

39:08.280 --> 39:09.510
What if I enter the nightmare in his consciousness

39:10.230 --> 39:11.590
and solve the problem bothering his mind?

39:13.480 --> 39:15.070
I remember you've researched this before.

39:15.760 --> 39:16.760
I have researched it,

39:17.140 --> 39:18.540
but there's no successful precedent.

39:19.000 --> 39:19.630
Do you know

39:19.920 --> 39:21.630
what kind of problem might be bothering his mind?

39:22.070 --> 39:22.700
Can you figure out

39:22.880 --> 39:24.400
what kind of nightmare he has fallen into?

39:27.550 --> 39:28.510
Human minds are complex.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.590
In the vast sea of consciousness

39:30.760 --> 39:31.400
and memories,

39:31.630 --> 39:33.480
it's not an easy task to find the problem bothering his mind.

39:33.880 --> 39:34.760
If you're not careful,

39:35.120 --> 39:36.290
you might be dragged into

39:36.320 --> 39:37.320
his nightmare, too.

39:37.670 --> 39:38.710
Then I still have to give it a try.

39:39.030 --> 39:40.000
If he dies,

39:40.320 --> 39:40.710
you

39:40.930 --> 39:41.890
won't survive, either.

39:45.280 --> 39:46.230
I want to take a gamble.

39:47.280 --> 39:47.920
I'm betting that

39:48.840 --> 39:50.400
he won't let me die with him.

39:58.480 --> 39:58.880
Alright.

39:59.400 --> 40:00.550
Since you've made up your mind,

40:00.710 --> 40:01.710
I can help you enter his dream.

40:02.030 --> 40:02.780
But Su Yishui

40:02.840 --> 40:03.960
can't hold on much longer.

40:04.550 --> 40:05.080
You need to

40:05.110 --> 40:06.120
break his nightmare

40:06.150 --> 40:06.960
before this incense burns out.

40:07.880 --> 40:08.280
Only then

40:08.550 --> 40:09.360
can both of you be safe.

40:30.740 --> 40:32.960
[Consonance Palace in Su Yishui's Dream]

40:31.870 --> 40:32.750
I finally found it.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.550
You betrayed your master and ancestors.

40:39.030 --> 40:40.150
You deserve to be cut into a thousand pieces!

40:40.960 --> 40:41.800
Su Yishui.

40:42.250 --> 40:43.410
Have you realized your mistakes?

40:49.070 --> 40:49.760
Stop!

41:01.540 --> 41:02.180
Master!

41:02.440 --> 41:03.290
Su Yishui!

41:15.960 --> 41:16.480
Why?

41:18.590 --> 41:19.880
Why can't I open it?

41:27.590 --> 41:28.110
Oh, no.

41:28.630 --> 41:30.230
Once the nightmare energy completely swallows his dream realm,

41:30.550 --> 41:31.920
he will never wake up again.

41:35.440 --> 41:36.510
This incense will burn out soon.

41:36.800 --> 41:37.550
If she doesn't come out now,

41:37.800 --> 41:38.290
the girl will

41:38.320 --> 41:39.300
trap herself inside.

41:39.480 --> 41:41.110
Liang, figure out a way now.

41:51.480 --> 41:53.030
Ranran, time is running out.

41:53.630 --> 41:54.800
If you give up now,

41:54.910 --> 41:56.390
I can still use all my life's energy

41:56.440 --> 41:57.190
to protect you and bring you out.

41:57.360 --> 41:59.130
But if we wait until the incense burns out completely,

41:59.710 --> 42:00.400
I'm afraid...

42:00.630 --> 42:01.360
I know.

42:01.810 --> 42:02.890
I just don't know why

42:03.190 --> 42:04.440
I can't enter his dream realm.

42:04.990 --> 42:05.830
You can't enter his dream realm?

42:06.440 --> 42:07.280
As far as I know,

42:07.400 --> 42:08.070
only when the dream master

42:08.070 --> 42:09.550
has set up a mental barrier around the dream realm

42:09.630 --> 42:10.840
will this situation occur.

42:11.030 --> 42:12.400
You need to break the dream master's mental defence first

42:12.630 --> 42:13.770
before you can be accepted by his dream realm.

42:14.030 --> 42:15.400
I can't stay in the dream realm for too long.

42:15.760 --> 42:16.360
From now on,

42:16.630 --> 42:17.670
you'll have to rely on yourself.

42:21.110 --> 42:22.630
What exactly is your mental defence?

42:23.320 --> 42:24.630
You betrayed your master and ancestors.

42:24.960 --> 42:26.030
You deserve to be cut into a thousand pieces!

42:26.840 --> 42:27.840
Su Yishui.

42:28.280 --> 42:29.320
Have you realized your mistakes?

42:37.760 --> 42:39.070
It's all my fault.

42:41.190 --> 42:43.190
If you had never met me,

42:44.190 --> 42:46.000
you wouldn't have been hurt by me

42:46.030 --> 42:47.030
again and again.

42:47.960 --> 42:48.510
That's not true.

42:49.000 --> 42:50.280
This is not your fault at all.

42:50.880 --> 42:52.070
Without having met each other before,

42:52.760 --> 42:54.370
even if we could avoid some pain,

42:54.860 --> 42:56.610
what about those happy times?

42:56.880 --> 42:58.060
Do you want to give them up too?

42:59.200 --> 43:00.090
You have brought me

43:00.120 --> 43:01.240
so much happiness in this life.

43:01.880 --> 43:02.510
From the past

43:02.670 --> 43:03.440
till now,

43:03.890 --> 43:04.920
you've always been a indispensable ray

43:04.940 --> 43:06.150
of light in my life.

43:11.760 --> 43:12.590
Could it be that

43:13.290 --> 43:14.410
light can break his mental defence?

43:33.840 --> 43:34.510
Shui!
